  "translate_en|mods/DeadWorksNomadRV/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/IG_UI.json|IGUI_GridRV_BackupNotice": "<CENTRE> <SIZE:medium> <RGB:1,0.75,0.25> RVs moved to the framework <LINE> <LINE> <LEFT> <SIZE:small> <RGB:1,1,1> The Nomad and Dale RVs now run on DeadWorks Vehicle Framework. Each RV and everything inside it, furniture, fridges, cupboards, water and batteries, converts the first time it loads. <LINE> That is meant to be automatic, but keep a backup from before this update in case anything goes wrong. <LINE>  <LINE> <RGB:1,0.75,0.25> How to back up <RGB:1,1,1> <LINE> 1. Quit to the main menu. <LINE> 2. Open your <RGB:0.55,0.85,1> Zomboid <RGB:1,1,1> folder, on Windows usually <RGB:0.55,0.85,1> C:/Users/your name/Zomboid <RGB:1,1,1> <LINE> 3. Copy the <RGB:0.55,0.85,1> Saves <RGB:1,1,1> folder somewhere safe. <LINE> To undo, put that copy back and go back to the previous version. <LINE>  <LINE> <CENTRE> <RGB:0.6,0.6,0.6> This message only shows once.",
  "translate_en|mods/DeadWorksNomadRV/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/IG_UI.json|IGUI_GridRV_BackupNoticeServer": "<CENTRE> <SIZE:medium> <RGB:1,0.75,0.25> RVs moved to the framework <LINE> <LINE> <LEFT> <SIZE:small> <RGB:1,1,1> The Nomad and Dale RVs now run on DeadWorks Vehicle Framework. Each RV and everything inside it, furniture, fridges, cupboards, water and batteries, converts the first time it loads. <LINE> That is meant to be automatic, but keep a backup from before this update in case anything goes wrong. <LINE>  <LINE> <RGB:1,0.75,0.25> How to back up <RGB:1,1,1> <LINE> 1. Stop the server. <LINE> 2. Open your <RGB:0.55,0.85,1> Zomboid <RGB:1,1,1> folder, on Windows usually <RGB:0.55,0.85,1> C:/Users/your name/Zomboid <RGB:1,1,1> <LINE> 3. Copy this server's folder under <RGB:0.55,0.85,1> Saves/Multiplayer <RGB:1,1,1> somewhere safe. <LINE> To undo, put that copy back and go back to the previous version. <LINE>  <LINE> <CENTRE> <RGB:0.6,0.6,0.6> This message only shows once.",
