  "translate_en|mods/GridRV/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/IG_UI.json|IGUI_ContainerTitle_GRRefrigerator": "Refrigerator",
  "translate_en|mods/GridRV/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/IG_UI.json|IGUI_GridRV_BackupNotice": "<CENTRE> <SIZE:medium> <RGB:1,0.75,0.25> Big Nomad RV update coming <LINE> <LINE> <LEFT> <SIZE:small> <RGB:1,1,1> The next update rebuilds how RV interiors are stored: furniture, fridges, cupboards and everything inside them. <LINE> Your RVs and their contents are meant to move over automatically, but please keep a backup in case anything goes wrong. <LINE>  <LINE> <RGB:1,0.75,0.25> How to back up <RGB:1,1,1> <LINE> 1. Quit to the main menu. <LINE> 2. Open your <RGB:0.55,0.85,1> Zomboid <RGB:1,1,1> folder, on Windows usually <RGB:0.55,0.85,1> C:/Users/your name/Zomboid <RGB:1,1,1> <LINE> 3. Copy the <RGB:0.55,0.85,1> Saves <RGB:1,1,1> folder somewhere safe. <LINE> To undo the update later, put that copy back. <LINE>  <LINE> <CENTRE> <RGB:0.6,0.6,0.6> This message only shows once.",
  "translate_en|mods/GridRV/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/IG_UI.json|IGUI_GridRV_BackupNoticeServer": "<CENTRE> <SIZE:medium> <RGB:1,0.75,0.25> Big Nomad RV update coming <LINE> <LINE> <LEFT> <SIZE:small> <RGB:1,1,1> The next update rebuilds how RV interiors are stored: furniture, fridges, cupboards and everything inside them. <LINE> Your RVs and their contents are meant to move over automatically, but please keep a backup in case anything goes wrong. <LINE>  <LINE> <RGB:1,0.75,0.25> How to back up the server <RGB:1,1,1> <LINE> 1. Stop the server before it updates. <LINE> 2. In the <RGB:0.55,0.85,1> Zomboid <RGB:1,1,1> folder, copy <RGB:0.55,0.85,1> Saves/Multiplayer/server name <RGB:1,1,1> and <RGB:0.55,0.85,1> db/server name.db <RGB:1,1,1> somewhere safe. <LINE> To undo the update later, put both back. <LINE>  <LINE> <CENTRE> <RGB:0.6,0.6,0.6> This message only shows once.",
